# DrumMania V (drmnvj), after drmnvj-card-new: the registered card again. cardutil check (registered:
# the password, the gdid), the name from the card, the password 1234, information and gametop get,
# two songs, gameend regist (the server's records add up), the card given back.
game drmnvj
at 11000 press "Coin 1" 8
at 11040 press "Coin 1" 8
at 11200 press "Card" 8
at 11400 press "1 Player Start" 8
